error[E0477]: a scope has one deadline: `within ms` or `until t`, not both
  --> tests/programs/concurrency/deadlines/e0477.la:2:31
  |
2 |     let r = scope s within 10 until 20 {};
  |                               ^^^^^
  |
  = help: a scope's settings come between its name and its body, each at most once: `scope conns independent limit 100 { … }`

For more about E0477, run `lughac explain E0477`.
